NAME
     tvremoted – Apple TV Remote services daemon

SYNOPSIS
     tvremoted

DESCRIPTION
     tvremoted manages discovery, connection, and communication with Apple TV
     devices on the local network.

LOCATION
     /usr/libexec/tvremoted

